starting_opacity=&#8221;100%&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; theme_builder_area=&#8221;post_content&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; header_3_font_size_last_edited=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: georgia, serif;\">William S.<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><i>&#8220;<span>I could not put this book down. The story enveloped me and the hope of Jesus poured out in every chapter. This book will show you the miracle work that Jesus is doing in our lives every day. It will inspire and renew your faith. It will light a fire of hope in your soul and refresh you with living water. I wanted to finish it so quickly but at the same time did not want it to end. It is a beautiful mix of story and study of the word.<\/span>&#8220;<\/i><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.15.1&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;33px||33px||true|false&#8221; border_width_bottom=&#8221;1px&#8221; border_color_bottom=&#8221;rgba(0,0,0,0.12)&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; theme_builder_area=&#8221;post_content&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; custom_padding_last_edited=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; custom_padding_tablet=&#8221;33px||33px||true|false&#8221; custom_padding_phone=&#8221;33px||33px||true|false&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.15&#8243; custom_padding=&#8221;|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; custom_padding__hover=&#8221;|||&#8221; theme_builder_area=&#8221;post_content&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.15.1&#8243; text_font=&#8221;||||||||&#8221; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; header_font=&#8221;||||||||&#8221; header_3_font=&#8221;Abhaya Libre|500|||||||&#8221; header_3_line_height=&#8221;1.4em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; theme_builder_area=&#8221;post_content&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; header_3_font_size_last_edited=&#8221;on|desktop&#8221; cus